### 5. Code Quality — **Ưu tiên thấp-trung bình**

#### 5a. Thiếu Unit & Integration Tests

```
src/test/   # Hầu như rỗng
```

**Đề xuất:** Ít nhất viết tests cho:
- [AuthServiceImpl](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/dacn/ITing/ITing-backend/src/main/java/com/iting/jobportal/auth/service/impl/AuthServiceImpl.java#20-115) — register, login, duplicate email
- [JobServiceImpl](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/dacn/ITing/ITing-backend/src/main/java/com/iting/jobportal/job/service/impl/JobServiceImpl.java#30-308) — CRUD, ownership check, search
- [ApplicationService](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/dacn/ITing/ITing-backend/src/main/java/com/iting/jobportal/application/service/ApplicationService.java#6-85) — apply, duplicate apply, withdraw

```java
@SpringBootTest
@Transactional
class AuthServiceTest {
    @Autowired AuthService authService;
    
    @Test
    void register_shouldCreateAccountAndUser() { ... }
    
    @Test
    void register_withDuplicateEmail_shouldThrowException() { ... }
    
    @Test
    void login_withBannedAccount_shouldThrow() { ... }
}
```

#### 5b. Magic Numbers trong Code

```java
// ❌ Hiện tại
.expiresIn(86400L)             // Magic number — 24 giờ?
if (days <= 0 || days > 365)   // Hardcode 365
int safeSize = Math.max(1, Math.min(size, 100)); // Hardcode 100
```

```java
// ✅ Đặt vào constants/config
@Value("${job.max-page-size:100}")
private int maxPageSize;

@ConfigurationProperties("jwt")
public record JwtProperties(String secret, long expiration) {}
```

#### 5c. `@Data` trên Entity — Hibernate Anti-pattern

```java
// ❌ @Data tạo hashCode/equals dựa trên tất cả fields → vấn đề với LazyLoading
@Data  // trên Account.java
public class Account { ... }
```

```java
// ✅ Dùng @Getter @Setter riêng, implement equals/hashCode dựa trên ID
@Entity
@Getter @Setter @NoArgsConstructor @AllArgsConstructor @Builder
@EqualsAndHashCode(onlyExplicitlyIncluded = true)
public class Account {
    @EqualsAndHashCode.Include
    @Id private Long id;
    ...
}
```

